{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the creator of the Piczle series comes the latest nonogram experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/header_1_en.png?t=1740453222\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/descrscreensh_1.jpg?t=1740453222\" />300 nonogram puzzles with both classic and color variations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/descrscreensh_2.jpg?t=1740453222\" />20 collage puzzles, made up of many smaller puzzles, both in classic and color variations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/header_2_en.png?t=1740453222\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/descrscreensh_3_en.jpg?t=1740453222\" />Unlock entries in the in-game Bestiary and learn more about the beasts of Rigbarth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/header_3_en.png?t=1740453222\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/descrscreensh_4_en.jpg?t=1740453222\" />Unlock entries in the in-game Compendium and learn about the characters in Rune Factory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/header_4_en.png?t=1740453222\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/descrscreensh_5_en.jpg?t=1740453222\" />Customise your farm, pick your spouse and choose your weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/header_5_en.png?t=1740453222\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/descrscreensh_6_en.jpg?t=1740453222\" />Play how you want: laid-back and relaxed or challenging! <br>A wealth of puzzle options to tweak the experience to your exact liking! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134280/extras/characters.png?t=1740453222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself, ...or don't! There is no wrong way to play!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Informed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3134280/4621464fd4ce93bc08a99814280efd17a16e4322.jpg"},{"name":"Who\u2019s who?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3134280/c8e35903b5d4db287623cdad9e20954fab5ea56f.jpg"},{"name":"First steps.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3134280/941a75daa4edac22f9587695a22f0725814fb847.jpg"},{"name":"Recruit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3134280/a3869f04f6776d392f40b5a7a17e6b3c52fb14ed.jpg"},{"name":"Patrol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3134280/f7dc0ce4f0936b7302ee2501201af7ceb43c6f1f.jpg"},{"name":"Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3134280/a29ee86741ca99c045c8d312fc07738bda547d30.jpg"},{"name":"Ranger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3134280/3251b5358a6fc76c907108679b4a01c07627cc92.jpg"},{"name":"Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3134280/6b9ee6e1944448e5b7c814e4d809e9a7c9ce7c5b.jpg"},{"name":"Warden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co